OL,5,G2100 Ceili House
OL,6,     FRTE Radio 1's Ceili House comes to
OL,7,     FJohn Lee's, Tullamore, for the
OL,8,     Ffirst of two programmes of
OL,9,     Ftraditional music, song and
OL,10,     Fconversation celebrating the
OL,11,     Fmusical heritage of Co Offaly.
OL,12,G2200 Folk on One
OL,13,     FBroadcaster and singer Muireann
OL,14,     FNic Amhlaoibh brings us a golden
OL,15,     Fhour of folk music both old and
OL,16,     Fnew, acoustic and traditional from
OL,17,     Facross Ireland and beyond.
